But note: the `state.containers` is an array of container elements (the dialog). The `mostRecentlyFocusedNode` is the button that was removed. The button is no longer in the DOM, so `container.contains(button)` will be false. Therefore, it should fall back to `getInitialFocusNode()`. However, the test still fails.

